        "factor": "Distress signals from Altman Z-score",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "A Z-score in the distress zone (~0.38) signals elevated bankruptcy risk absent mitigating factors; remains a meaningful tail risk."
